# Committed placeholders only. Real values go in .env.local (gitignored)
# or in Vercel / Supabase secrets. Spec §26.

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  PUBLIC — student web client (apps/web). Protected by RLS, not by secrecy.
